  "body": "Set in the thoughtfully designed Strathmill community, this brand-new Orewa home delivers the perfect blend of modern comfort, quality finishes, and contemporary style in a peaceful coastal setting.\r\n\r\nPrivately tucked away down a driveway and set back from the road, the property offers a sense of privacy and tranquillity, creating an ideal haven to unwind while remaining conveniently close to local amenities.\r\n\r\nDesigned with both style and functionality in mind, the home features quality upgrades throughout, including premium fittings and soft, plush carpeting. The light-filled open-plan living and dining area provides a welcoming space for everyday living, with an easy flow that makes entertaining family and friends a pleasure.\r\n\r\nKey features: \r\n• 3 well-proportioned bedrooms\r\n• 2 stylish bathrooms, including master ensuite\r\n• Single internal access garage\r\n• Approx. 100sqm of internal floor area set on a 300sqm (more or less) freehold section\r\n• Two heat pumps for year-round comfort \r\n• Contemporary kitchen with quality finishes\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, downsizing, or investing, this home offers a smart and versatile option in a high-growth location.\r\n\r\nEnjoy being just minutes from Orewa Beach, local shops, schools, and motorway access, with everything you need for an easy coastal lifestyle and convenient commuting close at hand.\r\n\r\nA private, modern home in a thriving coastal community—ready for you to move in and enjoy. Contact us today for further information or to arrange a viewing.",
